@startuml
title Request and response
concise "Client" as Client
robust "Server" as Server
binary "Ready" as Ready
@0
Client is Idle
Server is Idle
Ready is low
@20
Client is Request
Server is Busy
note top of Client : Request queued
@50
Server is Complete
Ready is high
@60
Client is Response
note bottom of Ready : Result available
@80
Client is Done
Client@20 --> Server@25 : dispatch
Server@50 --> Client@60 : reply
Client@20 <--> @60 : request latency
highlight 20 to 60 #LightYellow : processing
legend
Arrows connect times on different tracks.
endlegend
@enduml
